WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.800
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.430
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.140
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:40.320
It's regulating the Chaos Emerald energy pretty well.

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:44.370
It's in excellent condition. It sure feels good!

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:50.130
The Chaos Emerald is...

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:57.010
What is it? Something is pulling the aircraft.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.100
It's responding to something.

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:11.940
There must be something there!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.700
No! You can't land on the turf!

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.070
What?

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.130
Hey mister!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.710
Mister!

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.340
What are you doing?

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.510
It's a talking fox!

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:28.350
I'm sorry! I just... The Chaos Emerald started glowing and...

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:30.430
Will you please hear me out?

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:38.320
I want to believe you but... So that plane I just saw was yours.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:41.610
I'm sorry if I scared you.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:45.950
Anyway, this is a beautiful stadium!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.200
The turf is shining.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:54.040
Diamond Stadium has the best turf in the world.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:58.420
I've been taking care of it for decades.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:03:59.710
You have?

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:04.050
Yeah, but today's the last day for me.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:11.680
The Diamonds, led by manager Emer Johnson, are moving to a domed stadium with artificial turf.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.060
Therefore, this place is going to be demolished.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:18.570
Emer also liked the turf here.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:23.360
By the way, you were saying something about an emerald?

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:31.410
I'm looking for something that looks like this. It's called a Chaos Emerald.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.040
I have one too!

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.210
Why?

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:41.590
I found it buried under the dirt mound last night.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:55.140
What is that?

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.360
That light...

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:08.240
Dr. Eggman! Please take a look at that!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.580
That light is...

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.620
It seems to be coming from the stadium!

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.880
Stadium... Baseball...

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:26.050
The season for this has arrived.

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:32.040
Episode 10

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:32.040
Fierce Fight! Sonic Baseball Team

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:37.140
Let's start with the appetizer. Which fork and knife should you use?

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.360
Umm... these?

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.320
These.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:49.200
That's right! You're all smart. You're such good children.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:55.160
Why do we have to learn this?

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:58.960
In order to live in this world, you have to learn a lot of rules.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:03.300
I want to collect all the Chaos Emeralds as quickly as possible and go home.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.010
Sonic, that's bad manners.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:11.760
I wonder what's taking Tails so long to come home.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.560
I have a message for you from Dr. Eggman.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:21.610
Open your ears and listen up!

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:23.480
What? Eggman?

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:27.610
Where did you enter from? You have bad manners!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.990
Who cares if I've got bad manners!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:35.040
Hey, Sonic! Look out the window.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.200
What?

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:43.170
That's...

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.210
That's the light from a Chaos Emerald!

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:47.300
What?

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:51.930
And judging from the intensity of that light, it's not just one Chaos Emerald!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:59.060
At the base of that light, there should be several Chaos Emeralds.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:00.900
That location is...

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.690
Diamond Stadium!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.070
Stadium!

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:06.110
Baseball!

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:11.360
I'll pay you back for everything with this white ball!

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:18.870
This robot will automatically begin to hit a thousand balls.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:21.580
Hit?

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.380
Knock if off!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:36.430
You good for nothing!

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:39.600
She has a strong throwing arm.

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:41.690
We can use her.

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.100
We don't have time for this!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.290
What happened?

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.710
This is what happens when Chaos Emeralds come together.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.960
I hope that guy didn't see it.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.710
So it was you, Tails!

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.220
Eggman!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:19.810
You're the only one here? Where are the others?

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:23.730
Eggman, I'm never going to give you the Chaos Emeralds!

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:30.150
What are they doing? They're late. I hate it when guests don't show up on time.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:35.450
Do you guys really want to play? Have you guys been practicing swinging a bat?

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.870
What are you talking about?

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:43.160
If there aren't enough players, I have no business with a fox cub like you!

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.420
What is this?

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:57.930
Oh no! The Chaos Emerald!

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:05.850
I got the first one. Now hurry up and give me yours!

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:09.900
I don't want to stay here for a long time if we're not going to have a game.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:12.110
I'm not going to give this to you!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:18.780
Tails!

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.160
Tails, are you okay?

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:28.080
Knuckles! You came after all!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:33.090
Long time no see, Dr. Eggman.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:39.010
Knuckles! He arrived before Sonic.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:41.220
You must leave here quickly.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.680
You don't have to!

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.810
How are you, Knuckles?

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:59.530
So you came, Sonic. I was planning to get both Chaos Emeralds before you arrived, but...

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:03.450
You have enough players for a game.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:07.080
Eggman, give us back that Chaos Emerald!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:12.630
Then it's time for my players to make their entrance! Come, my robot baseball team!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.550
What is that?

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.190
Amy, I'm scared!

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:30.350
Don't worry.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:46.120
Sonic, I'll now teach you what real baseball is about.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:47.790
Prepare yourself!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.330
Prepare yourself!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.670
You can't play this game at this stadium!

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:56.260
We'll make you eat your words.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:01.010
I'll show you the spirit of ID baseball.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.760
Chuck?

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:06.560
So you're Chuck.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.520
Nice to finally meet you.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:14.730
I've seen you a lot on the Internet. Not only are you crazy about robots, but also about baseball.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:20.400
Anyway, this stadium has been carefully maintained for decades!

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:26.240
Eggman, I believe we can communicate as long as we have a ball and a bat.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:30.000
You're going to destroy the turf if you play here!

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:34.330
Why is that fox cub getting all worked up?

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:35.420
Beats me.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:36.380
Shut up!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.380
This turf means a lot to him!

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.300
It's okay.

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:46.390
This place is going to be destroyed anyways.

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:49.470
If I remember correctly, you're...

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:54.810
I'm Alfred Butler. I take care of the turf at this stadium.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:59.610
I've read about you in the papers!

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:03.950
You're the only man that Emer Johnson has ever complimented!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:06.030
Really?

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.660
It was a long time ago.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:16.250
I feel so overjoyed to be able to play in such a legendary stadium!

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:17.670
Play?

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:20.170
If you have all your players, then let's start!

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:21.220
Start what?

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.380
What's going to start?

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:27.640
Okay, let's begin the first Chaos Emerald Competition!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:31.810
What are you talking about? It's the Diamond Stadium Cup Baseball Tournament!

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.390
Baseball?

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:35.940
I thought something like this would happen.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:38.650
One, two, three, four.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:41.110
Well, why not?

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:43.570
Are we playing too?

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:44.780
I guess so.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.490
Let's give it all we got, everybody!

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:55.170
Grandpa, I'm sure that Eggman is planning something. We should be careful.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:13:00.630
You're right. His baseball strategy might be focused on running.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:02.840
That's not what I meant.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:07.430
Let's decide who bats first using rock-paper-scissors.

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:08.550
I'm against this!

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:14.940
You're going to wager a Chaos Emerald over a baseball game? You must have lost your mind!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:20.980
If we lose, Eggman will have two Chaos Emeralds!

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.400
What a wet blanket.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.400
You don't have to bum everyone out.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.070
You're lame.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.410
Lame.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.040
You guys!

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:35.750
You're the perfect example of a disgraceful samurai.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.170
Stop insulting me!

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.880
I'm not afraid of anything!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:41.090
Okay, Knuckles. Then it's all set.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.920
Fine, I'll do it! I'll do it!

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:49.640
I'm going to hit a home run every at bat. Just watch!

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.150
Play ball!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:04.150
Bring it!

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:10.450
Strike!

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:17.540
Strike!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:20.330
Strike! Batter out!

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:24.380
I can't handle pitches like that.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:29.510
Good, good! Keep it up!

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:32.350
Okay, you can count on me!

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.560
That's a strike.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.480
Umpire, that's not fair!

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:48.700
He has long arms. It can't be helped.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.410
If that's how you're gonna be...

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:58.370
Gotcha!

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:00.670
She did it!

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.170
She's used to hitting things.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:11.760
Out!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.930
What? No way.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:22.980
I'm better at pitching than at batting.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.110
Sorry, sorry.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:34.280
Strike!

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:42.250
Safe!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.790
This is ridiculous.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.340
It's an out-of-the-park home run!

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:55.850
Nicely done, Sonic!

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:57.560
It's a home run.

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:01.850
If you catch the ball outside the fences, it doesn't count as an out.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:06.150
Why do we have to play by the rules now? This is an anime!

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.240
Sorry, sorry.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.370
Unfortunately, that's a home run.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:20.660
All right! Knuckles, you're awesome!

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:24.920
Alright, it's okay!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:29.420
Huh? Are you sure it's okay? Am I on? Ahem!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:35.260
To all you TV viewers, we're bringing you a special emergency program starting now!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:39.510
At this moment, an unbelievable sight is occurring before my very eyes!

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:48.110
At the soon-to-be-demolished Diamond Stadium, Dr. Eggman and Sonic's teams are playing baseball!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:50.610
How did this whole thing come about?

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:58.490
I repeat! Dr. Eggman and Sonic's teams are playing a furious game of baseball. The location is...

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:00.580
Diamond Stadium!

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:08.590
I, Scarlet Garcia, will provide you with play-by-play of the game.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:09.960
SSTV.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:14.340
We only need 4 runs to turn the tables! Let's give it our best shot!

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:15.680
Tanaka!

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:16.470
Yes sir!

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:18.640
You're replaced by a pinch hitter!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:20.180
Cheese!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:31.900
Ball!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.440
Ball two!

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:36.820
Ball three!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.950
Ball! That's a walk!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.000
You idiot! You're useless!

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.000
Understand? Give it your best shot!

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:52.380
Okay.

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:55.970
Play ball!

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:57.970
Mr. Pitcher Robot!

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:02.890
Mr. Pitcher Robot, since long ago, I...

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:07.060
Mr. Pitcher Robot!

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.860
I...like...you...

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.740
Balk! Since you're so stupid, she gets a walk!

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:21.070
Hooray!

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.620
What do you think you're doing?

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:29.210
All right! Two consecutive home runs!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.630
Now we're tied!

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.460
Look, everybody!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.050
Hey!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.640
Hit a homerun this way!

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:43.640
What's this?

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.640
What on earth is going on?

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.190
I hate this!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.570
Finish this with the next batter!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:03.740
Strike!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:09.370
I'll never be able to hit a ball like this.

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:12.670
Strike two!

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:14.340
Time out!

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.340
Hey, Chris!

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:18.970
Sonic...

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:23.600
What's wrong, Chris? In this game, all you have to do is hit the ball with your bat.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:28.270
But... I can't hit a super pitch like that.

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:32.560
Who says you can't? That goes for everything, not just baseball.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:34.690
You have to face challenges headfirst.

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:38.570
First, you have to swing your bat.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:43.410
Play ball!

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:47.620
Sonic's right. I can't give up.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:51.040
I have to swing the bat with all my might!

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.000
Strike!

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.880
Like I thought, I couldn't do it.

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.420
Chris, run!

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:02.050
Alright! It's a passed ball!

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:07.890
Safe!

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:09.020
I did it!

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.060
I did it, Sonic!

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:19.070
We turned the tables! We did it!

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:23.860
How dare they! Playtime's over!

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:25.030
Here you go.

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:26.700
Why you...!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.120
What?

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:38.960
Oh no! My robot malfunctioned and is acting on its own!

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:42.170
If left as is, it'll explode! What shall I do?

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:44.260
What? Explode?

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:47.430
Damn! He's trying to get the game called off!

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.640
I'll shake this thing off!

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.060
This thing is stubborn!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:55.900
Sonic!

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:58.110
Jump, Sonic!

00:20:58.400 --> 00:20:59.070
Okay!

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:02.940
Don't do anything reckless!

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.990
You're a lifesaver!

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:14.210
My strategy failed!

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:20.250
However, I still took the Chaos Emeralds!

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:23.880
Dr. Eggman won after all!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.510
The Chaos Emeralds!

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:42.860
It was a fantastic game! It was a lot of fun!

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:53.950
Viewers, can you hear the applause? It was an excellent game befitting the end of Diamond Stadium, also known as the Green Jewel.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:56.790
That's...

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:05.470
Manager Emer Johnson!

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:11.510
I came after seeing the game on TV. It was a wonderfully spirited game.

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:19.940
It's all thanks to you, Al. This stadium will continue to shine in everyone's hearts.

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:21.770
Emer.

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:25.570
I'm thinking about moving this entire turf to the new stadium.

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:27.320
Will you help me?

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:28.990
Of course!

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:36.370
Although he took the Emeralds from us, we didn't lose something else that was important.

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:42.210
Though this concept doesn't exist in the Major League, today's game is a tie.

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:48.760
<b>Tabidatsu junbi wa dekita kai?</b>

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:48.760
<i>Are you ready to go on a journey?</i>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.010
<b>mata hitotsu asa ga kuru</b>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.010
<i>Another morning has arrived</i>

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:55.540
<b>Atarashii shatsu ni kigaete</b>

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:55.540
<i>Change into a new shirt</i>

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:59.040
<b>Kurayami wo nukedasou</b>

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:59.040
<i>And escape the darkness</i>

00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:02.480
<b>Nemuranai machi wa kyou mo</b>

00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:06.650
<i>The sleepless city quietly watches over you again today</i>

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:06.650
<b>Shizuka ni tada mimamotteiru</b>

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:12.660
<b>Kimi to boku ga hajimatteyuku!</b>

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:12.660
<i>We begin to go!</i>

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:16.270
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:16.270 --> 00:23:19.000
<b>Tomadowanai de</b>

00:23:16.270 --> 00:23:19.000
<i>Don't be bewildered</i>

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:25.920
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:25.920
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:30.970
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:30.970
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:33.780 --> 00:23:37.080
<b>Kimi to boku no sekai wo terasou</b>

00:23:33.780 --> 00:23:37.080
<i>Shine a light on our world</i>

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:40.600
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:44.110
<b>Kowagaranai de</b>

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:44.110
<i>Don't be scared</i>

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:50.280
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:50.280
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:54.680
<b>Haruka tooi michi no mukou gawa e</b>

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:54.680
<i>At the other end of the very long road</i>

00:23:54.680 --> 00:23:58.160
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:54.680 --> 00:23:58.160
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:02.290
<b>Kimi to boku no mirai mitsukeyou ze</b>

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:02.290
<i>Let's find our future</i>

00:24:30.170 --> 00:25:35.350
The Beautiful, Mysterious Thief Rouge
